 u gained from your summer to share in your resume\, cover letters\, inte
 rviews and personal statements. You will walk away with next steps to he
 lp you market yourself to potential employers. This program is open to a
 ll Princeton University undergraduates. Please register early as the spa
 ce is limited. The program location is by the Gallery in the Frist Campu
 s Center on the A Level. Please feel free to bring your lunch. This prog
 ram is open to all Princeton University undergraduates regardless of ide
 ntity. Email [careerdevelopment@princeton.edu](mailto:careerdevelopment@
 princeton.edu) to request accommodations at least two weeks prior to the
  program.\nAudience: Graduate Students\, Undergraduate Students\nRegiste
 r: https://app.joinhandshake.com/edu/events/1977030\nhttps://careerdevel
 opment.princeton.edu/events/career-essentials-series-marketing-your-summ
 er-experience
