SUMMARY:Georgetown Law School Virtual Info Session
DESCRIPTION:Join Georgetown Law Center’s (GULC) admission representativ
 e as they share in-depth information about GULC and what current and fut
 ure applicants should consider when applying. This is an opportunity to 
 learn about GULC clinics\, curriculum and admission criteria. You must a
 lso register through GULC (https://georgetown.zoom.us/meeting/register/E
 ZWfN9CTRUquFEuCfP-0iw#/registration) and you will receive a Zoom link to
  join the event. This program is open to all Princeton University underg
 raduate and graduate students regardless of identity. Email [careerdevel
 opment@princeton.edu](mailto:careerdevelopment@princeton.edu) to request
  accommodations at least two weeks prior to the program.\nAudience: Grad
 uate Students\, Undergraduate Students\nRegister: https://princeton.join
 handshake.com/edu/events/1995693\nhttps://careerdevelopment.princeton.ed
 u/events/georgetown-law-school-virtual-info-session
URL:https://careerdevelopment.princeton.edu/events/georgetown-law-school-
 virtual-info-session
