SUMMARY:Inside Look at Investment Banking Recruiting
LOCATION:Center for Career Development\, Conference Room
DESCRIPTION:Interested in recruiting for investment banking for summer 20
 28 internships? This workshop provides an in-depth look into investment 
 banking and its recruiting processes. You will hear advice from students
  who landed internships during last year’s recruiting cycle and their 
 strategies for success. We will also host an employer who will share wha
 t they look for in candidates. This program is open to all Princeton Uni
 versity undergraduates regardless of identity. Email [careerdevelopment@
 princeton.edu](mailto:careerdevelopment@princeton.edu) to request accomm
 odations at least two weeks prior to the program.\nRegister: https://pri
 nceton.joinhandshake.com/edu/events/1978665\nhttps://careerdevelopment.p
 rinceton.edu/events/inside-look-investment-banking-recruiting
URL:https://careerdevelopment.princeton.edu/events/inside-look-investment
 -banking-recruiting
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
